  <h2 id="stream-methods">Lazy <code>Stream&lt;T&gt;</code> Pipeline API</h2>
  <p>
    A <code>Stream&lt;T&gt;</code> evaluates elements lazily one at a time through intermediate steps when a terminal operation is invoked, enabling short-circuiting and infinite sequences (<code>iterate</code>, <code>generate</code>):
  </p>

  <CodeBlock
    title="streams_demo.aion"
    code={`println(iterate(1) { it * 3 }.limit(6).toList())
println(streamRange(1, 6).map { it * it }.filter { it % 2 == 1 }.sum())
stats := [10, 20, 30, 40].stream().summaryStatistics()
println(stats)`}
    output={`[1, 3, 9, 27, 81, 243]
35
Stats(count=4, sum=100, min=10, max=40, average=25)`}
  />

